'''Shuckle ex''' (Japanese: '''ツボツボex''' ''Tsubotsubo ex'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

