==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Solid Shell''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-Body}} on {{TCG ID|EX Crystal Guardians|Squirtle|64}} from the {{TCG|EX Crystal Guardians}} expansion.
*'''Triple Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|VS|Whitney's TM 02|108}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.

